OL,3,GNEWSAHomes evacuated as 'suspicious
OL,4,Apackage' destroyed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe bomb squad has carried out a
OL,7,Fcontrolled explosion in Kent after
OL,8,Fpolice found a "suspicious package".
OL,10,FKent Police found the item as they
OL,11,Fattended a fire just after 22:00 BST on
OL,12,FWednesday at a property in Dura Way,
OL,13,FFolkestone.
OL,15,FNearby residents were evacuated and the
OL,16,Froad was closed, they said.
OL,18,FAn Explosive Ordnance Disposal team
OL,19,Ffrom the Ministry of Defence (MoD)
OL,20,Fcarried out a controlled detonation as
OL,21,Fa precaution, the force added.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
